  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's sensor and motion capabilities, separating perception and actuation. The specification binds perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery only when needed and prioritizing forward exploration. Recovery with move_backward and full_rotate is strictly limited to dedicated states, and the supervisor always returns to forward progress as soon as possible.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (sensor outcomes) and actuation (motion commands)",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-maximizing exploration with conservative, minimal recovery and strict avoidance of unsafe or oscillatory behaviors"
